    "description": "RPC is an acronym for Remote Procedure Call. This happens when the program delegates the execution of a piece of code to a separate server.\n\nPHP offers xml-rpc, gRPC, Protocol Buffers also called protobuf, and Yar as different standard ways to do RPC.",
